    <section id="research">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Our Research Areas</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
                We focus on groundbreaking research that pushes the boundaries of biological science and creates real-world applications.
            </p>
            <div class="research-grid">
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>🧪 Molecular Biology</h3>
                    <p>
                        Exploring the mechanisms of molecular processes including DNA replication, protein synthesis, and gene regulation. Our research helps understand disease mechanisms at the molecular level.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>🔬 Genetics & Genomics</h3>
                    <p>
                        Advanced genetic studies using next-generation sequencing technology. We analyze genomic data to identify biomarkers and understand hereditary traits and diseases.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>🦠 Cellular Engineering</h3>
                    <p>
                        Developing innovative cellular therapies and tissue engineering approaches. Our work bridges basic research with therapeutic applications for regenerative medicine.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>💊 Biomedical Research</h3>
                    <p>
                        Investigating therapeutic targets and developing drug candidates. We collaborate with pharmaceutical partners to translate research into clinical solutions.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>📊 Bioinformatics</h3>
                    <p>
                        Using computational methods and machine learning to analyze complex biological datasets. Our bioinformatic pipelines enhance data interpretation and discovery.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="research-card">
                    <h3>🧬 CRISPR & Gene Editing</h3>
                    <p>
                        Advancing gene editing technologies for therapeutic development. We explore applications of CRISPR-Cas9 and other gene editing tools for disease treatment.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

